{"3757070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cleaning The Ocean", "steam_appid": 3757070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is full of secrets. Most of them are trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot &quot;The Cleaner,&quot; a compact, upgradeable submarine through hand-crafted underwater zones teeming with life, debris, and things best left undisturbed. Your mission is simple: clean it all up. Getting there is anything but. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect plastic, tires, fishing nets and sunken junk from the ocean floor. Sell what you haul, upgrade your sub, and push deeper into waters that grow quieter — and stranger — the further you go. Small fish can be captured and catalogued. Sharks are a different story. And some things down here don't fit neatly into either category. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning The Ocean is a game about the satisfaction of a job well done, the joy of discovery, and the particular unease of realizing something very large has noticed you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras/6f945cf913fa7f428e6c8fad75a181bc.avif?t=1778999326\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive through diverse ocean zones — each with its own ecosystem, hidden areas, and escalating mystery. Every zone cleaned brings you one step closer to a healthier, quieter sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras/2ac35edce2220dd1f315de4e31d7ecd8.avif?t=1778999326\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras_big/2ac35edce2220dd1f315de4e31d7ecd8.webp?t=1778999326 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLECT &amp; CLEAN </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuum up debris, haul trash piles, and drag sunken wreckage back to the surface. Progress is visible — the ocean actually gets cleaner as you play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras/0481606dd5946b9fde1fda2564b38e1c.avif?t=1778999326\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras_big/0481606dd5946b9fde1fda2564b38e1c.webp?t=1778999326 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPGRADE YOUR SUB </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your collection net, boost engine speed, upgrade your sonar, and unlock new tools and gadgets. Build the sub that fits your playstyle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras/652bb131413aaa10290ca91df9f1bf1b.avif?t=1778999326\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras_big/652bb131413aaa10290ca91df9f1bf1b.webp?t=1778999326 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCOVER OCEAN LIFE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Catalogue hundreds of sea creatures. Capture the harmless ones. Outrun the dangerous ones. Observe the ones you can't explain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras/8521c448d2d99dc889b60b101a71e02e.avif?t=1778999326\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOMETHING IS DOWN THERE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper zones hide more than trash. Keep your headlights on.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is full of secrets. Most of them are trash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot &quot;The Cleaner,&quot; a compact, upgradeable submarine through hand-crafted underwater zones teeming with life, debris, and things best left undisturbed. Your mission is simple: clean it all up. Getting there is anything but. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect plastic, tires, fishing nets and sunken junk from the ocean floor. Sell what you haul, upgrade your sub, and push deeper into waters that grow quieter — and stranger — the further you go. Small fish can be captured and catalogued. Sharks are a different story. And some things down here don't fit neatly into either category. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning The Ocean is a game about the satisfaction of a job well done, the joy of discovery, and the particular unease of realizing something very large has noticed you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757070/extras/6f945cf913fa7f428e6c8fad75a181bc.avif?t=1778999326\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive through diverse ocean zones — each with its own ecosystem, hidden areas, and escalating mystery. Every zone cleaned brings you one step closer to a healthier, quieter sea. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.st